  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Open Fun Football Schools Pgrm seeks to support peace, confidence,    tolerance, equality, particulary in the enclave of Transnistria with  other parts of Moldova through football activities. Main target group children age 7-11 including parents, leaders, coaches,                representatives of authorities, in coop with Moldovan partners. Cross Cultures Project Association is the implementing partner.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Open Fun Footfall Schools i Moldavien genomf&#xf6;rs av Cross Cultures     Project Association i samarbete med moldaviska partners och avser att fr&#xe4;mja fred, tolerans, j&#xe4;mlikhet och verka konfliktf&#xf6;rebyggande i     fr&#xe4;mst enklaven Transnistrien genom fotbollsaktiviteter. M&#xe5;lgrupp &#xe4;r  barn i &#xe5;ldrarna 7-11 &#xe5;r,samt inkluderande f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ldrar, ledare, coaches, myndighetspersoner.</narrative>
  </description>
